    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_name_text:gEventName000",
   "pool": "event_name_text",
   "symbol": "gEventName000",
   "en": "１Ｆ　Ｅｎｔｒａｎｃｅ　Ｐａｒｔ１　　　　　　　　{END}",
   "max_units": 30,
   "units": 30,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text00",
   "en": "What a weird place!\nEverything’s kinda springy and\nsoft.{END}",
   "max_units": 63,
   "units": 63,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text01",
   "en": "Nice and warm, too.\nI’m startin’ to feel like a nap.{END}",
   "max_units": 58,
   "units": 58,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text02",
   "en": "Shouldn’t you be a little more\nworried?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 45,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text03",
   "en": "Who’s there?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 17,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text04",
   "en": "Don’t you get it?\nYou’re inside the belly of\nMonstro the Whale.{END}",
   "max_units": 70,
   "units": 70,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text05",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text05",
   "en": "Why, I know that voice…{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 28,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text06",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text06",
   "en": "Pinocchio?  Pinoke, it’s you!\nCome on out!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 48,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text07",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text07",
   "en": "Is that you, Jiminy?\nGosh, I never thought I’d meet\nyou here.{END}",
   "max_units": 68,
   "units": 68,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text08",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text08",
   "en": "You can’t get away from me,\nson.  I’m your conscience.{END}",
   "max_units": 60,
   "units": 60,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text09",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text09",
   "en": "Your conscience should guide\nwhatever you do.  Remember?{END}",
   "max_units": 62,
   "units": 62,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text10",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text10",
   "en": "Sure, Jiminy. \nI’ve been a good boy while you\nwere gone.{END}",
   "max_units": 63,
   "units": 63,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text11",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text11",
   "en": "I didn’t tell a single lie.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 32,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text12",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text12",
   "en": "Uh-oh!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 11,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text13",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text13",
   "en": "Well, for Pete’s sake!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 27,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text14",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text14",
   "en": "Oops!\nBut…how did YOU end up inside\nMonstro, anyway?{END}",
   "max_units": 59,
   "units": 59,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text15",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text15",
   "en": "We, uh, sort of used a special\nway…{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 41,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text16",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text16",
   "en": "It’s so special, we don’t know\nhow we did it!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 51,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text17",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text17",
   "en": "That’s too bad…  I was hoping\nyou could help me and Father\nget out of here.{END}",
   "max_units": 82,
   "units": 82,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text18",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text18",
   "en": "Well, I’ll be!\nGeppetto’s here, too?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 42,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent074Text19",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent074Text19",
   "en": "Sure.\nWant to see him?  Follow me!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 40,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent075Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent075Text00",
   "en": "Geppetto!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 14,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent075Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent075Text01",
   "en": "Bless my soul, it’s Jiminy\nCricket.  How in the world did\nyou get here?{END}",
   "max_units": 78,
   "units": 78,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent075Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent075Text02",
   "en": "You tell me!  How does a\nclockmaker wind up in the belly\nof a whale?{END}",
   "max_units": 75,
   "units": 75,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent075Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent075Text03",
   "en": "Well, it’s a long story…{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 29,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent075Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
